    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Policy 1: Reform Area 1: Public financial management systems strengthened
Outcome 2: Objective: Expansion of the taxpayer base for income tax:

Policy: The government secured parliamentary approval and has amended the Income Tax Ordinance, 1984 for all holders of TIN (except those taxpayers who do not have a taxable income but have obtained a TIN for the purpose of sale of land or acquiring a credit card) to submit an annual income tax return for FY2021 and for each year thereafter. 
 
