    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Policy 1: Reform Area 1: Public financial management systems strengthened
Outcome 3: Objective: Enhance efficiency and improve taxpayer services:

Policy: NBR has rolled out the use of a simplified income tax return form for use by marginal taxpayers to file returns for FY2021 and for each year thereafter. 
 
Action 1: na
