    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Policy 1: Reform Area 1: Public financial management systems strengthened
Outcome 4: Objective: Enable improved tax compliance and minimize tax avoidance through identifying discrepancies in respect of tax liabilities and payments of firms and businesses:

Policy: NBR issued an order to mandate the exchange of information between its income tax and VAT division, enabling the use of data from either division&amp;apos;s database for a more comprehensive audit of firms and business entities selected for audit by either division. 
 
Action 1: na
