    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Policy 1: Reform Area 1: Public financial management systems strengthened
Outcome 5: Objective: Address tax evasion, ensure due collection of VAT through digitalization, and thus facilitate improved VAT compliance:

Policy: NBR completed the commissioning of at least 1,000 EFD, requiring businesses to use them for issuing electronic tax invoices for every sale transaction. 
 
Action 1: na
