    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Policy 1: Reform Area 1: Public financial management systems strengthened
Outcome 7: Objective: Promote transparency and ensure accurate, efficient and timely transfer of cash assistance directly to beneficiaries:

Policy: The government issued an order to expand the use of the G2P platform such that:
(i) benefits transfers for all new enrolments from 1 July 2021 will only be permitted through the G2P platform; and
(ii) all remaining currently enrolled beneficiaries receiving payments outside the G2P platform will be progressively migrated to the G2P platform by 30 June 2022. 
 
Action 1: na
