    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Policy 1: Reform Area 1: Public financial management systems strengthened
Outcome 8: Objective: Freeing up scarce public resources:

Policy: The government initiated closure of SOEs in select sectors, commencing with orders to close jute mills, that were incurring losses, with
effect from 1 July 2020; and allocated Tk35 billion to pay for all outstanding dues and arrears to workers who were retrenched. 
 
Action 1: na
