    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Policy 1: Reform Area 1: Public financial management systems strengthened
Outcome 9: Objective: Improve allocative efficiency and predictability of public expenditure, and strengthen expenditure control measures:

Policy: The government, through its budget circular for FY2022, issued a policy directive to line ministries that no increases in ministry-wise Annual Development Program allocations will be permitted during the year. 
 
Action 1: Access to finance
